"primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161303687", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998469889", "personaname": "GlizzyGoblin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/trucky/", "num_games_owned": 200, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 12439, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6437, "last_played": 1748566197, "avatar": "f3e02a2723482ac144048e6c5473634cfb0f6de5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Democracy needs me...", "timestamp_created": 1711237708, "timestamp_updated": 1711237708, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161303656", "author": {"steamid": "76561198215074739", "personaname": "ARU", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198215074739/", "num_games_owned": 115, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 45710, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 182, "playtime_at_review": 6617, "last_played": 1788045040, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "ABOUT THIS GAME\n\nThe Galaxy’s Last Line of Offence.\n\nEnlist in the Helldivers and join the fight for freedom across a hostile galaxy in a fast, frantic, and ferocious third-person shooter.\n\n\nURGENT BROADCAST – SUPER EARTH ARMED FORCES\nFreedom. Peace. Democracy.\nYour Super Earth-born rights. The key pillars of our civilization.\nOf our very existence.\nBut the war rages on. And everything is once again under threat.\nJoin the greatest military force the galaxy has ever seen and make this a safe and free place to live.\n\n\nBECOME A LEGEND\nYou will be assembled into squads of up to four Helldivers and assigned strategic missions.\nWatch each other’s back – friendly fire is an unfortunate certainty of war, but victory without teamwork is impossible.\n\n\nLOADOUTS\nRain down freedom from above, sneak through enemy territory, or grit your teeth and charge head-first into the jaws of combat.\nHow you deliver liberty is your choice; you’ll have access to a wide array of explosive firepower, life-saving armor and battle-changing stratagems… the jewel in every Helldiver’s arsenal.\n\n\nREQUISITION\nSuper Earth recognises your hard work with valuable Requisition. Use it to access different rewards that benefit you, your squad, your destroyer ship and our overall war effort.\n\n\n\nTHREATS\nEverything on every planet wants you dead. That’s what we’re dealing with.\nEach enemy has distinct and unpredictable characteristics, tactics, and behavior – but they all fight ferociously and without fear or morality.\n\n\nTHE GALACTIC WAR\nCapturing enemy planets, defending against invasions, and completing missions will contribute to our overall effort.\n\n\nThis war will be won or lost depending on the actions of everyone involved.\n\nWe stand together, or we fall apart.\nREAD MORE\nMATURE CONTENT DESCRIPTION\nThe developers describe the content like this:\n\nHELLDIVERS™ 2 is a 3rd person squad-based shooter that sees the elite forces of the Helldivers battling to win an intergalactic struggle to rid the galaxy of the rising alien threats. From a 3rd person perspective, players use a variety of weapons (pistols, machine guns, flamethrowers) and stratagems (turrets, airstrikes, etc.) to shoot and kill the alien threats. Players can also aim down the sights for a more accurate 1st person camera view. Combat is accompanied by frequent sprays of blood and dismemberment as players exterminate the alien forces or players and squad mates are hit by environmental explosions or friendly fire. Enemy encampments and battlefield environments depict bloodstains and dismembered corpses.\n", "timestamp_created": 1711237678, "timestamp_updated": 1711237678, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161303555", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006568716", "personaname": "vtkamal", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006568716/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 28111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 213, "playtime_at_review": 951, "last_played": 1787622700, "avatar": "fc26bc4530c98a717107b1b52be9ee944ff25bc4"}, "language": "english", "review": "REVIEW DIVERS UNITE", "timestamp_created": 1711237573, "timestamp_updated": 1715129947, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161303541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135634268", "personaname": "Strangelove", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gwynocide/", "num_games_owned": 287, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 3698, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3016, "last_played": 1771358234, "avatar": "7327d43eb4fad3ce3543ddeef0967d21ad98724d"}, "language": "english", "review": "eagle-1", "timestamp_created": 1711237559, "timestamp_updated": 1711237559, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161303461", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025310368", "personaname": "Tetsujin1x", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025310368/", "num_games_owned": 411, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 46648, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1033, "playtime_at_review": 4962, "last_played": 1788056908, "avatar": "5b1897d332ff7ce3eb4dee9f76cdf212364afcab"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm an old cape-spinner from back in the day... I know how lucky we are we actually got this sequel. \n\nIt came as no surprise to me that this game was good. As this first(?) war/story arc goes on, it is gloriously clear... it's just going to get even better from here.\n\nArrowhead has been grinding in the trenches for years and have long deserved a true financial and critical hit. They finally got both with Helldivers 2. Congratulations to them!  I can't wait to see what new toys, factions, and stories they bring to this fancy new table.\n\nJust a couple of nights ago I air-dropped my Exosuit gingerly, impossibly, on top of a light pole... totally and completely out of reach (really should've screenshotted that) as a Bile Spewer made me liquid lunch. Later in the same session, I accidentally tagged my Rover with my own Airstrike strategem and blew myself into gibs.\n\nBoth times, I just smiled, and perhaps wiped a small, liberty-laden tear from my cheek... and popped back into another Hellpod... prepared to spread Managed Democracy... one more time. Who wants to live forever?\n\nIt feels really, really good to be back. Thank you, again, to the whole team at Arrowhead (and, I guess, Sony, by proxy) for another chance to play in this silly, special little world they've created.", "timestamp_created": 1711237476, "timestamp_updated": 1711237476, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161303454", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090687305", "personaname": "C_CarrotCake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ant272727/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1982, "last_played": 1711673094, "avatar": "4fc4098dc8c842282ff6a8eb8dd7cacaca7a5f6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "DO you yearn for Oil and Bugs to rain down below your feet as you march forward and claim victory for glorious Democracy!?!?! Yeah now get your boots tightened, crack open a can of freedom, and *EAGLE SCREECH* LOCK IN HELLDIVERS!!!", "timestamp_created": 1711237459, "timestamp_updated": 1711237459, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}